WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.769
Three questions. One perfect product.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.033
It opens on a free trial product, chosen just for you.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.838
One tap, and the quiz begins.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:17.087
Just between us: your age, your skin, and your two main concerns.

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:23.701
Then it matches a product to you.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:27.001
Pick up your free trial at your nearest boutique.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:32.435
Your voucher arrives by email, ready to collect.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:39.948
Behind it is the original, rebuilt eleven years on. Twenty-three scripts became one module.

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:45.566
Static files at the edge, Go behind them, and questions held as data.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:51.366
Amazing Landing: three questions, one product, one boutique.
